WEBVTT

00:04:59.462 --> 00:05:05.301
and that is that sometimes we use busyness
as a way to numb ourselves out.

00:05:05.801 --> 00:05:07.053
I’ve experienced that.

00:05:07.386 --> 00:05:09.805
This is my boy Gideon,

00:05:09.805 --> 00:05:12.975
and he died in 2013.

00:05:13.476 --> 00:05:15.561
I’d had him for 17 years,

00:05:15.561 --> 00:05:17.146
and he was my best friend.

00:05:17.605 --> 00:05:19.899
And after he died,

00:05:19.899 --> 00:05:20.900
I’ll be honest,

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:23.277
I didn’t want to be home

00:05:23.277 --> 00:05:25.905
because I knew that he wouldn’t be there.

00:05:26.614 --> 00:05:29.825
And so for two years,

00:05:29.825 --> 00:05:34.580
my life basically
was an Uber to an airport,